{"4358730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BannerRush", "steam_appid": 4358730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4866470, 4911720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/ab800015de5d89f6fea55cc97077bf51.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/ab800015de5d89f6fea55cc97077bf51.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/ab800015de5d89f6fea55cc97077bf51.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/5eee357be6c1592154e28506a1b817c4.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/5eee357be6c1592154e28506a1b817c4.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">“Banner Rush” is a tactical real-time duel in which you build your army, activate abilities, buy boosters, and try to overwhelm your opponent's enemy lines with massive waves of attacks. You earn points for each crossing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Whoever has the most points at the end wins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command <strong>knights</strong> for epic melee battles, <strong>archers</strong> to attack or fend off enemies from a distance, or wield dark magic by recruiting <strong>shadowy mag</strong>es and sending them into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Construct buildings</strong> to <strong>boost</strong> your <strong>economy</strong>. Each building grants you <strong>strategic options</strong>. They also maximize efficiency on the lanes where they’re located. If you dominate a lane, you’ll receive <strong>bonuses</strong> and <strong>double points</strong>. That’s your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the heat of battle, break <strong>open chests</strong> to get <strong>useful items</strong> and <strong>gold</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your <strong>fighters gain experience</strong> with every strike on the battlefield. <strong>Collect XP</strong> and use it to <strong>unleash ultimate power</strong>, from <strong>infernos</strong> and <strong>earthquakes</strong> to <strong>mass conversion</strong> or <strong>holy power</strong>. Every decision changes the course of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No two battles are alike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/be716be52241162b146a595f00d6f05b.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/be716be52241162b146a595f00d6f05b.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget about slowly taking down towers. Forget about the enemy base. In “Banner Rush,” the winner is whoever sends more troops across the enemy line. Every breakthrough earns a point. Every point increases the pressure on the opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five rounds. Then the finale, which turns everything upside down: Round 4 counts double, Round 5 counts triple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No lead is ever safe. No match is decided until the very last second has ticked away. A heart-pounding experience is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The online 1-on-1 mode is the beating heart of Banner Rush. Test your tactics against players from around the world, or start with a single-player campaign that teaches you the game step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/3ec4069d530b098b1be1406f282bcdd2.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/3ec4069d530b098b1be1406f282bcdd2.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/13559a93e9f043399357eab56827650d.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/13559a93e9f043399357eab56827650d.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/13559a93e9f043399357eab56827650d.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After each round, you have the opportunity to change, adjust, or completely overhaul your strategy against your opponent in the “Tactics Forge.” Here, you can take your time planning what your opponent is about to experience firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use Forge Points to build your plan: add new units to your regiment, or perhaps construct buildings to increase the speed of your troop reinforcements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or should you opt for new general abilities that affect all your troops?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use gold to equip yourself with boosters and spells that you can activate in the heat of battle to support your troops or sabotage your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More brute force or all-in magic? Defend or break through? You decide what to use in battle. Chance determines only when.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge Points at the end of each round, Gold in the thick of battle. Calm planning here, frantic juggling there. Master both and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/e14f2385b96f90148a229bd66f77fef3.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/e14f2385b96f90148a229bd66f77fef3.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Three pillars, three functions. The Economy pillar provides you with gold, the Workshop speeds up troop reinforcement, and the Oracle boosts your magic. They remain active for several rounds and can be upgraded up to level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And then there are the walls. They help you defend your lines. They weaken enemies and hold firm at maximum durability. This lets you stop your enemies so you can attack them from a distance with archers or use magic against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the real benefit is lane dominance. Control a lane if there is at least one building on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your troops on that lane become stronger, and when you break through the enemy line, you earn double the points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>But be careful: If your opponent also places a higher-level building on that lane, you lose dominance and your opponent gains it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/001cd6f01c212904ac6adef3d2394a89.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/001cd6f01c212904ac6adef3d2394a89.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/8a252f77fccc2d73278aa628475bc765.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/8a252f77fccc2d73278aa628475bc765.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/8a252f77fccc2d73278aa628475bc765.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chain your attacks into combos, earn XP in battle, and unleash a game-changing Ultimate. 16 Ultimates across 3 tiers: The higher the tier, the more powerful the effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rain treasure chests down on your own half of the map, envelop your opponent in a cloud of poison, or go all out: an earthquake, an inferno, or a mass conversion that draws every enemy unit on the field to your side and makes them fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/f17a7f1b922b6508dfb367fdf0c33ba1.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/f17a7f1b922b6508dfb367fdf0c33ba1.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/cdc53cd2068d7011b8a2ac5ec9b14952.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/cdc53cd2068d7011b8a2ac5ec9b14952.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/cdc53cd2068d7011b8a2ac5ec9b14952.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Running out of supplies in the middle of battle?<br>A signal sounds, and a chest appears. Send your troops to break it open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">500 gold? A fireball? Healing potions?<br>A General Skill like “All Units +20% Damage”?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From the simple standard chest to the legendary golden chest,</strong><br><br><strong>their contents can completely turn the tide of a game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/07fc78631e5c7377bf8692fa7ce9a826.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/07fc78631e5c7377bf8692fa7ce9a826.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The king is dead. Long live the king! But the throne should have been yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A conspiracy drove you from the kingdom you once served as its greatest general. Now you return to overthrow the false king and put an end to his reign of terror. The single-player campaign tells this story and guides you step by step through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But don’t think it will be easy. The sophisticated AI system has emotions. It reacts defensively and offensively and, if necessary, aggressively. It purchases items and unlocks skills just like you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/ab800015de5d89f6fea55cc97077bf51.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/ab800015de5d89f6fea55cc97077bf51.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/ab800015de5d89f6fea55cc97077bf51.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/5eee357be6c1592154e28506a1b817c4.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/5eee357be6c1592154e28506a1b817c4.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">“Banner Rush” is a tactical real-time duel in which you build your army, activate abilities, buy boosters, and try to overwhelm your opponent's enemy lines with massive waves of attacks. You earn points for each crossing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Whoever has the most points at the end wins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Command <strong>knights</strong> for epic melee battles, <strong>archers</strong> to attack or fend off enemies from a distance, or wield dark magic by recruiting <strong>shadowy mag</strong>es and sending them into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Construct buildings</strong> to <strong>boost</strong> your <strong>economy</strong>. Each building grants you <strong>strategic options</strong>. They also maximize efficiency on the lanes where they’re located. If you dominate a lane, you’ll receive <strong>bonuses</strong> and <strong>double points</strong>. That’s your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In the heat of battle, break <strong>open chests</strong> to get <strong>useful items</strong> and <strong>gold</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your <strong>fighters gain experience</strong> with every strike on the battlefield. <strong>Collect XP</strong> and use it to <strong>unleash ultimate power</strong>, from <strong>infernos</strong> and <strong>earthquakes</strong> to <strong>mass conversion</strong> or <strong>holy power</strong>. Every decision changes the course of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No two battles are alike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/be716be52241162b146a595f00d6f05b.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/be716be52241162b146a595f00d6f05b.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forget about slowly taking down towers. Forget about the enemy base. In “Banner Rush,” the winner is whoever sends more troops across the enemy line. Every breakthrough earns a point. Every point increases the pressure on the opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five rounds. Then the finale, which turns everything upside down: Round 4 counts double, Round 5 counts triple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No lead is ever safe. No match is decided until the very last second has ticked away. A heart-pounding experience is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The online 1-on-1 mode is the beating heart of Banner Rush. Test your tactics against players from around the world, or start with a single-player campaign that teaches you the game step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/3ec4069d530b098b1be1406f282bcdd2.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/3ec4069d530b098b1be1406f282bcdd2.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/13559a93e9f043399357eab56827650d.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/13559a93e9f043399357eab56827650d.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/13559a93e9f043399357eab56827650d.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After each round, you have the opportunity to change, adjust, or completely overhaul your strategy against your opponent in the “Tactics Forge.” Here, you can take your time planning what your opponent is about to experience firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use Forge Points to build your plan: add new units to your regiment, or perhaps construct buildings to increase the speed of your troop reinforcements?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or should you opt for new general abilities that affect all your troops?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use gold to equip yourself with boosters and spells that you can activate in the heat of battle to support your troops or sabotage your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More brute force or all-in magic? Defend or break through? You decide what to use in battle. Chance determines only when.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forge Points at the end of each round, Gold in the thick of battle. Calm planning here, frantic juggling there. Master both and claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/e14f2385b96f90148a229bd66f77fef3.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/e14f2385b96f90148a229bd66f77fef3.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Three pillars, three functions. The Economy pillar provides you with gold, the Workshop speeds up troop reinforcement, and the Oracle boosts your magic. They remain active for several rounds and can be upgraded up to level 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And then there are the walls. They help you defend your lines. They weaken enemies and hold firm at maximum durability. This lets you stop your enemies so you can attack them from a distance with archers or use magic against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the real benefit is lane dominance. Control a lane if there is at least one building on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your troops on that lane become stronger, and when you break through the enemy line, you earn double the points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>But be careful: If your opponent also places a higher-level building on that lane, you lose dominance and your opponent gains it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/001cd6f01c212904ac6adef3d2394a89.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/001cd6f01c212904ac6adef3d2394a89.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/8a252f77fccc2d73278aa628475bc765.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/8a252f77fccc2d73278aa628475bc765.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/8a252f77fccc2d73278aa628475bc765.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chain your attacks into combos, earn XP in battle, and unleash a game-changing Ultimate. 16 Ultimates across 3 tiers: The higher the tier, the more powerful the effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rain treasure chests down on your own half of the map, envelop your opponent in a cloud of poison, or go all out: an earthquake, an inferno, or a mass conversion that draws every enemy unit on the field to your side and makes them fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/f17a7f1b922b6508dfb367fdf0c33ba1.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/f17a7f1b922b6508dfb367fdf0c33ba1.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/cdc53cd2068d7011b8a2ac5ec9b14952.poster.avif?t=1783253174\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/cdc53cd2068d7011b8a2ac5ec9b14952.webm?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/cdc53cd2068d7011b8a2ac5ec9b14952.mp4?t=1783253174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Running out of supplies in the middle of battle?<br>A signal sounds, and a chest appears. Send your troops to break it open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">500 gold? A fireball? Healing potions?<br>A General Skill like “All Units +20% Damage”?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>From the simple standard chest to the legendary golden chest,</strong><br><br><strong>their contents can completely turn the tide of a game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras/07fc78631e5c7377bf8692fa7ce9a826.avif?t=1783253174\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/extras_big/07fc78631e5c7377bf8692fa7ce9a826.webp?t=1783253174 width=1560 height=316 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The king is dead. Long live the king! But the throne should have been yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A conspiracy drove you from the kingdom you once served as its greatest general. Now you return to overthrow the false king and put an end to his reign of terror. The single-player campaign tells this story and guides you step by step through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But don’t think it will be easy. The sophisticated AI system has emotions. It reacts defensively and offensively and, if necessary, aggressively. It purchases items and unlocks skills just like you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Banner Rush is a tactical real-time duel in which you build up your army and overrun the enemy lines with a massive assault. Fight for every lane and seal the victory in the final showdown, when every breakthrough counts double or triple.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/bf90b3960946da8fee6f180181c7c11b6663878b/header.jpg?t=1783253174", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4358730/6d2e102deb4d412041ec3f3aa6df4182929a6c03/caps